          "A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. Link each value to the field or page that supports it. Name the repository where sensitive evidence is held. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. For customer follow-up promise, the working file keeps promise entry and ticket number beside the decision note. The service coordinator keeps the customer follow-up promise owner and date beside the queue entry.",
          "Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. Mark missing evidence as missing, with a reason, rather than leaving a blank. Keep a version label on every file that can change. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. Every customer follow-up promise handoff names the service coordinator and the field in the promise register that will confirm the change. The service coordinator keeps the customer follow-up promise owner and date beside the queue entry."
