          "A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. Keep the queue view readable on one screen. Check that the owner is actually available before assigning. Assign every unowned case before new work begins. Apply the same customer follow-up promise test to due date and to the value that survives in the promise register. The service coordinator keeps the customer follow-up promise owner and date beside the queue entry.",
