          "Keep the prior value so the change can be explained. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. Record the close reason with the same codes used in the exception queue. Every customer follow-up promise handoff names the service coordinator and the field in the promise register that will confirm the change. The service coordinator keeps the customer follow-up promise owner and date beside the queue entry.",
